                                                                                
 Usage: opentide mcp [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                                
                                                                                
 Run the opentide MCP server for editors and agents                             
                                                                                
 The server speaks on stdio. The editor owns the process: stop is the host      
 closing stdin, and reload is the host spawning this command again. There is no 
 reload or stop subcommand.                                                     
                                                                                
